menu "hifi-receiver lab"
	config HIFI_LAB
		bool "Lab build: experiments a signed command starts and stops"
		default n
		help
			Adds the "lab" API (esp/hifi_lab_esp.c) and its experiments
			(esp/lab_*.c). Set by board/lite-lab; off in a product image.
	config HIFI_LAB_DRILL
		bool "Rollback drill: the lab reports itself broken"
		depends on HIFI_LAB
		default n
		help
			The image's trial then fails ("the lab frame isn't up") and the
			board must roll back to the image before it by itself. Set only by
			board/lite-lab-drill, to prove that it does.
	config HIFI_LAB_DRILL_STUCK
		bool "Stuck-tick drill: the lab's tick hangs holding its lock"
		depends on HIFI_LAB
		default n
		help
			Once per power-up, 5 minutes after boot, the lab's tick hangs
			holding the lab's lock (as a stuck experiment stop would). The
			watch must restart the board within HIFI_LAB_STUCK_MS, and the
			self-test after it says "the lab restarted it, its tick stuck".
			Set only by board/lite-lab-stuck, to prove that.
endmenu
